# Secrets live encrypted in contexts/<name>/secrets.enc (and, for whole
# files, contexts/<name>/secrets/*.enc) — both ARE committed. See "ens
# workflow secrets edit" and workflow.yml's context.secrets.variables. Only
# an accidental plaintext secrets.env needs ignoring — note this is distinct
# from contexts/*/variables.env, which IS committed (non-secret
# per-environment config, see workflow.yml's context.variables).
contexts/*/secrets.env

workspace